      "content": "Fellow neighbors, the act of voting is not a suggestion; it is a bedrock responsibility owed to your community and to future generations. Abstention is not apathy; it is a conscious surrender of your power to those who do not share your vision for this town. When we choose not to participate, we are effectively handing over our voice to the loudest few, eroding the very contract that holds our democracy together. Rise to this call—show up and vote, because to be a steward of this community is to engage fully.",
