      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To those who claim protest through silence, I offer this stark reality: your absence is not resistance; it is complicity in the very forces you despise. When you stay home because you deem the choices inadequate, you are not rejecting the system—you are volunteering for its continued, unrestrained reign. This passive refusal allows corruption and ineptitude to consolidate power without meaningful challenge. True moral protest is not walking away; it is confronting the broken system head-on by ensuring your voice is counted.",
      "source": "target",
